| Layer              | Technology                                   |
| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------- |
| Frontend           | Next.js / React                              |
| Language           | TypeScript                                   |
| Backend            | Laravel / PHP                                |
| Database           | MySQL                                        |
| Authentication     | Laravel Sanctum SPA / Session Authentication |
| API                | REST                                         |
